\newlabel{fig:probing}{{5}{9}{\textbf {Temporal primitive probing: balanced accuracy (\%)} of a linear classifier on frozen TimesFM~2.0 embeddings. Pretrained (\emph {left}) consistently outperforms random-weight control (\emph {right}) for seasonality and volatility across all four datasets}{figure.caption.26}{}}
